{"id":"vod_bf_24524","vodId":"24524","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"男子高中生的日常","name_cn":"男子高中生的日常","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-25/86f5cc1344060bed035299bf678fd44b.jpg"},"summary":"《男子高中生的日常》以真田北男校为舞台，围绕着主角忠邦（入野自由 配音），以及他的死党秀则（杉田智和 配音）和吉竹（铃村健一 配音）的日常高中生活而展开。忠邦主要担任吐槽的角色，长相中性的他常常被秀则和吉竹联合欺负。登场人物还有同校学生会的元治、唐泽、副会长和会长等人，这是一群基本上没有女朋友的男校学生，在鲜有女生参与的情况下，展开了插科打诨的日常高中生活。　　这是一部搞笑向的作品，内容短小，笑点十足。动画以每集一个小故事的节奏，采用“男子高中生与XX”的标题形式，将男子高中生的爆笑日常故事呈现给观众。　　本作根据山内泰延的同名漫画《男子高中生的日常》改编而成。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:29:29","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/nanzigaozhongshengderichang/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/nanzigaozhongshengderichang/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/nanzigaozhongshengderichang/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/nanzigaozhongshengderichang/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/nanzigaozhongshengderichang/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/nanzigaozhongshengderichang/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/nanzigaozhongshengderichang/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/nanzigaozhongshengderichang/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/nanzigaozhongshengderichang/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/nanzigaozhongshengderichang/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/nanzigaozhongshengderichang/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/nanzigaozhongshengderichang/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],